flowchart TD
    PUSH([Push to master]) --> AUTH[OIDC login]
    AUTH --> PULL[DVC pull]
    PULL --> TEST[Fast + slow tests]
    TEST --> BUILD[Build Docker image]
    BUILD --> ACR[(Push image to ACR)]
    ACR --> DEPLOY[Update Container App]
    DEPLOY --> SMOKE[Health + prediction checks]
    SMOKE --> DONE([Write deploy summary])

    classDef start fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#111827
    classDef action fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#111827
    classDef gate fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#111827
    classDef result fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#111827
    class PUSH start
    class AUTH,PULL,BUILD,ACR,DEPLOY action
    class TEST,SMOKE gate
    class DONE result
